  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening UK-Thailand Partnerships: Advancing Democracy, Human Rights, and Sustainable Trade and Economic Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to meet with government officials, parliamentarians and civil society organisations to encourage constitutional reform, support greater political participation, and defend human rights, ultimately creating a more stable democratic government that can drive greater trade and sustainable growth between the UK and Thailand.</narrative>
  </description>
